{"title": "Zariel's Protection (Condition)", "pageid": 28733, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Zariel's_Protection_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Physical Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Zariel's Protection</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>When attacked, Mizora will disappear to the Hells and return after a minute. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GLO_MIZORA_INVULNERABLE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GLO_MIZORA_INVULNERABLE+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GLO_MIZORA_INVULNERABLE+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>All damage is reduced to 0, making Mizora effectively unkillable.</li>\n<li>Damage-over-time effects still persist, resulting in Mizora disappearing and reappearing until the effect ends.</li>\n<li>In previous patches, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flesh_to_Stone\" title=\"Flesh to Stone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Flesh_to_Stone_Icon.webp/20px-Flesh_to_Stone_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Flesh_to_Stone_Icon.webp/30px-Flesh_to_Stone_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Flesh_to_Stone_Icon.webp/40px-Flesh_to_Stone_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flesh to Stone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Flesh_to_Stone_Icon.webp/20px-Flesh_to_Stone_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Flesh_to_Stone_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flesh_to_Stone\" title=\"Flesh to Stone\">Flesh to Stone</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flesh_to_Gold\" title=\"Flesh to Gold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp/20px-Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp/30px-Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp/40px-Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flesh to Gold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp/20px-Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Flesh_to_Gold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flesh_to_Gold\" title=\"Flesh to Gold\">Flesh to Gold</a> could <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(Condition)\" title=\"Petrified (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"petrify\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(Condition)\" title=\"Petrified (Condition)\">petrify</a> Mizora. However, as of patch 8 (and potentially patch 7) this is no longer possible. If she fails all saving throws and receives the petrified condition, she immediately loses it again.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Creatures_with_Zariel.27s_Protection\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Zariel's_Protection\">Creatures with Zariel's Protection</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/30px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/45px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/60px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mizora\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/30px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195435\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1749/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18450/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7074/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1231815/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.201      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   54.201      1 -total\n 46.80%   25.368      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.13%   14.163      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 20.43%   11.074      4 Template:Icon_link\n 19.45%   10.543      4 Template:Icon_text\n 16.45%    8.917      1 Template:SmCond\n 13.62%    7.382     17 Template:Trim\n 12.28%    6.655      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 11.63%    6.301      3 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28733-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195435 and revision id 394669. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}